WEBVTT

00:07:59.888 --> 00:08:02.542
an opportunity
to get diagnosed or treated.

00:08:04.782 --> 00:08:08.083
"Doctor, is this really necessary?"

00:08:08.472 --> 00:08:11.789
I know this can be
a difficult question to ask.

00:08:12.377 --> 00:08:14.276
In fact, if you go back 50 years,

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.653
this was even considered rude.

00:08:16.677 --> 00:08:17.799
(Laughter)

00:08:17.823 --> 00:08:20.269
If the doctor had decided
what to do with you,

00:08:20.293 --> 00:08:21.627
that's what you did.

00:08:23.574 --> 00:08:25.819
A colleague of mine,
now a general practitioner,

00:08:25.843 --> 00:08:30.184
was sent away to a tuberculosis
sanatorium as a little girl,